*** APPREGN - a SIT override deck written for this repository.
***
*** Supplied to a run, this is what turns every resource's `installed` from `unknown`
*** into a real answer. Without it every row says `unknown`, which is the honest default
*** and not a failure.
APPLID=CICSAPP1
SYSIDNT=APP1
GRPLIST=(APPLIST,DFHLIST)
GMTRAN=APMN
PLTPI=PI
PLTSD=SD
XLT=SD
MXT=200
DSALIM=5M
SEC=YES
START=AUTO
.END
